---
import { site } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="provenance" class="section frame" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="craft-title">
  <div class="craft-grid">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Made with care</p>
      <h2 id="craft-title">The details make the difference.</h2>
      <p>A proper Mac app, from keyboard shortcuts to the last progress pixel.
        A separately tested Swift engine underneath. Open code, so the care is there to inspect.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={site.repo}>Explore the source <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a>
    </div>
    <div class="principles">
      <article>
        <h3>At home on your Mac.</h3>
        <p>SwiftUI, familiar controls, and quiet updates in your menu bar and Dock.</p>
      </article>
      <article id="privacy" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
        <h3 id="privacy-title">Your Mac. Your business.</h3>
        <p>No app telemetry, accounts, or automatic crash uploads. Your download library stays on your Mac.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={site.privacyPolicy}>Read the privacy policy <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Better, together.</h3>
        <p>Free under the MIT licence. Inspect it, build it, or help make the next detail better.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
